              'Between 2022 and 2026, the more exposed an occupation was to AI, the more its postings fell. That much we knew. What is new is that over the past year <strong>the relationship flipped</strong>: software development postings are up roughly <strong>15%</strong> since late February 2025, while total postings across the country <strong>fell 7%</strong>. So the market did not collapse: it is coming back.',
