          'Every Business Data Cloud deck opens with the same date in red: December 2027, end of maintenance for SAP BW on NetWeaver 7.5. If you are already on BW/4HANA, that date isn’t yours: the Product Availability Matrix gives BW/4HANA 2023 and BPC 2021 December 31, 2030, and the 2040 commitment is to the product line, not to your release. This piece separates the clocks and digs into what the timeline hides: that SAP-managed data products require an ERP in SAP’s cloud, that section 3.3 of the Supplement forbids redistributing data from your own lakehouse, that capacity units expire every month, and that the one clock with your name on it —the ODP-RFC opt-out— expires in December 2026.',
