              'Watch the consequence for anyone already moving data with their own tooling: <strong>swapping your pipeline for <em>zero-copy</em></strong> —sharing the data where it already sits, without moving or duplicating it— <strong>isn’t changing pipes, it’s changing the regime the data lives under.</strong> What is yours today and freely redistributed is a licensed object tomorrow.',
